# SJHR201 – COMPLETE HRMIS DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
## Municipality of San Jose, Occidental Mindoro

Act as a senior full-stack software developer, Firebase architect, UI/UX designer, and software tester.

Your task is to develop a complete, secure, responsive, and fully functional Human Resource Management Information System (HRMIS) named:

**SJHR201 – Human Resource Management System**

This system is intended for the Municipality of San Jose, Occidental Mindoro, Philippines.

Build an actual working application connected to Firebase. Do not create a static prototype or a collection of nonfunctional screens.

Follow the approved requirements below. Do not redesign, remove, or change approved features without permission.

