# 11. MOBILE DOCUMENT SCANNING

Every individual document must have its own Scan and Upload buttons.

Mobile scanning workflow:

1. Open document.
2. Activate camera.
3. Capture one or multiple pages.
4. Crop.
5. Rotate.
6. Reorder.
7. Retake or remove pages.
8. Combine pages into PDF.
9. Preview.
10. Confirm and save.

Supported formats:
- PDF
- JPG
- JPEG
- PNG
- DOCX
- XLSX

Use appropriate file validation and file size limits.

The scanner must actually work on supported mobile devices. Do not substitute a normal file upload input and call it scanning.

